{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-2","storyName":"擅闯者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"两个讲解员互不相让地争辩身份真伪时，高登已经意识到，他放任一个冒牌货在园区活动了一个月。所幸，冒牌货只是个导游，为帮助一位女妖客人才混了进来。另一边，“幸运瘤兽”的经理按照神秘通话人的指引，来到了高登的秘密收藏室。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["奥克里？","奥克里！","高登","梅希亚","费尔南","奥克里","娜斯提","资深研究员","雅斯彭","不明造物","太空鳞兽"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"-80,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"0.8","afrom":"1","ato":"1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"哥们儿，要是你真喜欢这个名字，拿去用也就算了，没必要剽窃我的人生经历啊！","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"50,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.8","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里！","text":"你怎么好意思倒打一耙，所有资料和简历都是我亲自写的！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#6$1","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"20,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.8","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"你能原样复述吗？","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里！","text":"这......这都是我一年前写的东西了，怎么可能一字不差！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"“奥克里，堡垒山人，毕业于特里蒙文理学院，曾在特区会展中心工作，担任人类发展与技术跌新部门的讲解专员......”","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"“迭新”还写错了。","id":26},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里！","text":"你！可恶，要不是我弄丢了终端和资料简历——","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"subtitle","text":"高登的头从来没有这么疼过。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":38},{"type":"subtitle","text":"再次确认资料后，他一眼就看出了报到流程上的漏洞，但最大的问题不在于此——","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":39},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她究竟为什么要假冒讲解员？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":40},{"type":"subtitle","id":41},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她是莱塔尼亚派来刺探科技实力的间谍，受国防部直接命令的情报探子，还是特区政府安插在自己身边的眼睛？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":42},{"type":"subtitle","text":"预展上，这个冒牌货已经跟大部分企业有过接触，现在处理她就等同于把自己的疏忽昭告天下。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":43},{"type":"subtitle","text":"更要命的是，高登完全不知道她究竟探听到了多少消息，是否会对自己不利、对哥伦比亚不利......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":44},{"type":"subtitle","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"高登不敢想下去了。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"......","id":50},{"type":"charslot","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"20,0","posto":"20,0","isblock":"true","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"......你说话的时候眼神游移，语无伦次，声音发颤。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"我想以长官的眼光也不会选择这样一位“奥克里”担任宣传工作吧？","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里！","text":"你少把长官扯进来！我告诉你——","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"都别吵了！","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-150,0","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"......","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里！","text":"......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"280,0","posto":"140,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"奥克里“先生”，您需要冷静一下，跟我来吧，我带您去贵宾室休息。","id":72},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"140,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"250,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.1","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.1","isblock":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-180,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"高登长官，我......","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你给我听好了，我刚刚调取了你在园区里的行为记录，弄清你的真实身份也易如反掌。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你要是再撒一次谎，我会立刻把你从六百多米的高空扔下去。不管你是什么人，最后都会变成地上的一摊烂泥，明白吗？","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"说，你是谁。","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"......讲解员......","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"有骨气。","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里？","text":"旅、旅行时需要的那种讲解员！","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我叫费尔南，是个......导游。","id":110},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"奥克里先生，真是非常抱歉，高登长官一定会尽快解决这件事，给您一个交代的。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"你们相信我了？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"当然。有什么需要您都可以通过这个终端联系我，现在我就先不打扰您休息了。","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"好。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.2","id":132},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"1","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"搞定。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"察言观色，提前为上司规避风险......","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"这也是秘书准则。","id":148},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":159},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":160,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你说，一个月前奥克里失恋喝醉酒，把讲解员的简历当作联系方式给了你，正好让你得以借用他的身份，带人混进我的园区？","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"是的。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你的客人是一位年迈的女妖，不知道为什么在骸骨荒原迷路了，她记忆模糊，交流起来也很费劲？","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"没错。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你怀疑她得了病，为了让她的旅程顺心，你只能借讲解员的身份跟人打听解决方法，所以才显得心怀不轨？","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"完全正确！","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你在园区待了一个月，知道这里的特殊性。如果你是其他国家派来的间谍，军方会拷打你，审问你，让你再也回不了家。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"如果你是国防部的情报专员，特区政府不会放过你，他们会颠倒黑白甚至将你驱逐出境，只为能争得更多话语权。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"如果你是特区政府的眼线，那你知道得太多，我有很多从管理局学来的手段，强制让你“失忆”。","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"但你只是名体贴游客的导游，是一个好人。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"而哥伦比亚从不会亏待好人。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"长官......您不追究我的责任啦？","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我很想追究，但因为你在预展上的表现，许多企业代表已经注意到了你。趁他们查出你的来历前，你必须处理完自己的问题，立马滚蛋。","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你待得越久，我就要花越多补偿金，安抚那个被你顶替的倒霉蛋。如果你只是想让那位女妖客人恢复清醒，我可以帮你。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"您知道女妖相关的知识？","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我知道怎么解决你的问题。","id":194},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_38_g10_ecolab.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2051_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"开始接入浮空种植单元。","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_activation","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"驱动装置接收到生物电信号，正在充能。","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"呼......最顺利的一次实验，不是吗？","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_signlntrfrnc","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"不对，这个声音......断点保护装置自发启动了。","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）解离。","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_1","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_powerengine_run","volume":"0.4","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）解离！","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_1","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_powerengine_run","volume":"0.4","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"啧。","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_machinedeath","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2051_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","isblock":"true","focus":"r","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"主任，你怎么能直接用手处理过载的能源转换器！","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"它比我的咒言更有效。参数如何？","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"作为即将在展会上披露的成果来看，利用植物进行高空能量传输的技术已经成熟，但如果要满足你对整个项目的期望......","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"还不够，浮空种植单元的能量传输阈值还没到达最初的理论值。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"要是你在那个炸毛的丰蹄小子面前也这么说，他就不会整天气呼呼的了......","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"斯凯经验不足，但有一点说得没错——这座生态园是克丽斯腾留下的东西，我们必须做到最好。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"唉，五年前我跟你一起在地下建能量井的时候，你就是这个倔脾气。","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"为了保证结构强度，你不眠不休地为上万件核心建材施加咒言，哪怕用你最喜欢的蚯蚓软糖引诱你去休息都无济于事。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"钓鳞应该去苏里根湖，如果你的请假申请能被我批准的话。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"......","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"而且，本就是因为我效率低下，才会需要不眠不休。我学习咒言太晚，仅以声音作为媒介，我咒言的精准程度和强度都会低于同族。","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"所以你改造了自己的骨笔，还用打孔纸带作为施咒的辅助媒介？","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯，我走了很多弯路。","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"娜斯提拿出自己的骨笔，笔身没有丝毫装饰和雕刻，如一件莱茵出品的科技造物。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"她将骨笔插进生态园培育的树苗上，白色的荧光从根部升起，顺沿叶脉，流进每一片树叶。","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"整个生态园仿佛被注入了一道指令，终端程序开始运转，自动记录植物能量转换的相关数据。","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_activation","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"2.3","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2051_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"0","isblock":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"咒言对你而言，还真是一种高效的程序语言......","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那与之相对地，在实验出现瓶颈的当下，我们也应该做一个有些冒险但更高效的决定。","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"主任，你是说......","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"再去核验一遍报告吧，辛苦。","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"是。","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonering","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#11$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephone","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你好，莱茵生态园实验室。","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"娜斯提主任您好。高登长官想让我转达他的谢意，上次能达成合作多亏您的通情达理。","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不过协议还涉及一些后续事宜需要跟您商谈，请问今天下午您有时间吗？","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"有。","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"太好了，一小时后，我们生态园见。","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"......","id":307},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_elevator","loop":"true","channel":"ele","volume":"0","id":314},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"ele","fadetime":"2","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"坐索道，到飞天甜甜圈站下，再走环形廊道......","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我应该没找错地方吧？好黑，灯在哪里......","id":317},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":319},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ele","fadetime":"1","id":320},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"天空保佑......这、这是什么地方！","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"playsound","key":"$alarmenter","volume":"0.8","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.92","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$relax_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_relax_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":338,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$6","isblock":"true","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不明造物","text":"发现入侵者，发现入侵者！","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$3","isblock":"true","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"不明造物","text":"生物扫描开启，评估基础信息：泰拉人，男性，威胁程度待定。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","isblock":"true","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"一只......会说话的鳞兽？","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$2","isblock":"true","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"不知好歹的泰拉人，注意你的言辞！我是太空鳞兽零五四，快报上你的宇宙身份识别码。","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","isblock":"true","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"身份识别码......？","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$6","isblock":"true","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"（小声）就是您的企业名称。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","isblock":"true","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"哦哦，幸运瘤兽餐饮。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$3","isblock":"true","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"哼，原来你就是“天空征服者”命令我接应的合作伙伴，看来不能试验我的激光炮了，可惜。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$6","isblock":"true","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"（小声）请不要碰任何东西，长官马上就到。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","isblock":"true","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"长官？","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"0.8","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$6","isblock":"true","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"零五四，下次为客户说明的时候，也要记得用外泰拉生物的方式说话。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"遵命。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","isblock":"true","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"高、高登长官？！","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"嘘——别咋咋呼呼的。身处这间全泰拉绝无仅有的奇珍异品收藏室，先用眼睛赞叹才符合礼仪。","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"看看你右边那面墙。五年前，一个拓荒者试图非法越境。收缴所有物时，我在他的移动板房里发现了一套设计特殊的净水循环系统。","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"为了将功抵过，他偷偷替我找到了核心部分，组装后我认出它是“咒术湍流焦点”，一件萨卡兹的巫术武器。","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","isblock":"true","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"天，那一定很危险......","id":379},{"type":"dialog","id":380},{"type":"charslot","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"转身。这是产自莱塔尼亚的三头施术单元。一名巫王残党想要增加源石技艺的输出强度，撕裂时空，召唤他们的王。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"撕裂时空太过天方夜谭，但它的能源转换效率足足超出园区规定值的五十倍，用它施术之后连洋葱都能飞起来。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","isblock":"true","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"等等，所以您解决“一只靴子”的技术问题的方法是......向他们提供违禁品？","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"违禁品？“只能使用哥伦比亚制造的零件”是死板的管理局给“螺旋桨天堂”定下的新规矩！","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我不懂，也不想揣测背后的原因。我只知道，那些根本不符合哥伦比亚进取精神的规则让科学家束手束脚，逼得企业家只能说谎！","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"结果呢？是一个小小的管理局官员将来自泰拉各地的发明运入园区，为三分之一的浮空设施安上了心脏。","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"三分之一......您做成了上百次走私交易，到现在都还没有暴露过？","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"在我的管理下，每笔交易、每个环节都顺利得不可思议，连经常在我身边的秘书小梅都不知道我的“秘密”。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"高登长官，我还是需要时间考虑......","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"“幸运瘤兽”的寿命只剩下最后一天，而我接下来还有其他要务需要处理，只能给你，嗯，五秒钟。","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"告诉我，你是要为“幸运瘤兽”换上一颗杂交的心脏，还是要让它抱着无聊的、不属于你的坚持去死？","id":402},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":406},{"type":"charslot","id":407},{"type":"background","id":408},{"type":"image","id":409}],"characters":["奥克里？","奥克里！","高登","梅希亚","费尔南","奥克里","娜斯提","资深研究员","雅斯彭","不明造物","太空鳞兽"]}